  "pros": [
    "Efficient task creation and tracking for daily work",
    "Easy to navigate and understand for team collaboration",
    "Centralized place for project documents and updates"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Lack of advanced features like detailed reporting or complex dependencies",
    "Notifications could sometimes be overwhelming or easily missed",
    "Limited visibility of project timelines and progress without a dedicated calendar tool"
  ],
  "changed": [
    "pro 1: 'Simplified communication and task tracking for daily work' changed to 'Efficient task creation and tracking for daily work' because multiple notes highlighted the efficiency of task creation (e.g., 'after saving one to-do it immediately opens a blank one', 'typing a name and pressing Enter added each further deliverable in a single step', 'one inline form held name, assignee... and the deliverable showed its assignee and 'Fri, Oct 30' chips on the list right after saving').",
    "con 3: 'Finding specific files might be cumbersome within the system' changed to 'Limited visibility of project timelines and progress without a dedicated calendar tool' because the note '[friction] My Events showed only 'No events today' for October and did not list the to-do due Oct 28, so it was not usable to check project progress by date without a project Calendar tool' directly points to a lack of a key feature for project progress visibility, which is a more significant and specific limitation than general file finding."
  ]
}
